TRACK 3 VERDICT: v6 is at a measured LOCAL OPTIMUM. Seven independent
  perturbations -- kbranch 4, world budget x2, calibrated PF params,
  no-veto, particles x2, cross-world exact endgame, 3-ply -- ALL tie
  within noise. The search architecture is saturated at its cost
  point; the remaining ~14 pts/hand of oracle headroom is not
  reachable by local moves. Next frontiers are structural: Track 4
  subgame solving (fusion-free use of the particle ranges), match
  scoring + human evaluation (roadmap #5/#6), or a fundamentally
  better opponent model class.
  KEPT INFRASTRUCTURE: ladder.py (playout_deep_n, LadderExpert --
  the n-ply machinery, parity-proven), pf_expert search_cfg/CLI knobs.

